# EntEdit example data – J. G. Ballard – catalogue
# Two music recordings whose tracks are named after Ballard stories (Dream cargoes, The isle is full
# of noises), with their track works, expressions and persons. ISFDB has no such records.
# Self-contained: links to nothing in the isfdb2lrm conversion. Do not load together with the merged
# Ballard-*.ttl files, which already contain these records.

